<title>PORTUGAL: FORECAST-Results for top Portuguese blue-chips.</title>
<headline>FORECAST-Results for top Portuguese blue-chips.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a table of analysts' results forecasts for a number of leading Portuguese companies. Figures are in billions of escudos, with brackets indicating a loss.</p>
<p>		  BCP   BTA  CIMPOR   PORTUCEL  TELECOM  SONAE INV</p>
<p>BANCO CISF</p>
<p>1996</p>
<p>Net profit    n.a   18.1   27.8	(0.7)    49.2	9.1</p>
<p>Cashflow	n.a   n.a    44.0	 6.1    162.3     26.9</p>
<p>1997</p>
<p>Net profit    n.a   18.8   23.5	 6.9     57.4	9.8</p>
<p>Cashflow	n.a   n.a    39.4	13.9    179.8     29.7</p>
<p>FINCOR</p>
<p>1996</p>
<p>Net profit    n.a   n.a    24.0	 1.3     50.4     13.6</p>
<p>Cashflow	n.a   n.a    41.5	 8.3    176.3     30.6</p>
<p>1997</p>
<p>Net profit    n.a   n.a    24.9	 9.1     61.7     15.7</p>
<p>Cash-flow     n.a   n.a    39.7	17.2    195.7     35.5</p>
<p>M.VALORES</p>
<p>1996</p>
<p>Net profit    22.1  16.5   18.2	(0.4)    47.3     12.2</p>
<p>Cashflow	73.9  43.4   37.6	 6.9    161.6     28.1</p>
<p>1997</p>
<p>Net profit    24.3  16.9   21.7	 7.3     60.6     14.8</p>
