<p>TOTTADEALER</p>
<p>1996</p>
<p>Net profit    20.4  n.a    24.6	 0.6     46.1     10.9</p>
<p>Cashflow	n.a   n.a    42.4	 8.0    162.1     28.1</p>
<p>1997</p>
<p>Net profit    25.5  n.a    20.1	 5.6     55.2     13.5</p>
<p>Cashflow	n.a   n.a    39.1	13.5    179.5     35.0</p>
<p>GESFINC</p>
<p>1996</p>
<p>Net profit    23.5  17.3   20.2	 1.0     49.0	8.0</p>
<p>Cashflow     133.7  41.6   41.5	 8.2    165.0     34.3</p>
<p>1997</p>
<p>Net profit    24.9  17.7   21.9	 8.9     58.0     10.1</p>
<p>Cashflow     141.8  39.2   40.1	16.4    180.0     41.0</p>
<p>The full company names are Banco Totta &amp; Acores, Banco Comercial Portugues, Cimpor-Cimentos de Portugal, Portucel Industrial, Portugal Telecom, Sonae Investimentos.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3113121</p>
